                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The time period in a cycle during which the cycle is low, especially the lower part of a sine wave fitted to a measurement of a circadian pattern or other biological rhythm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31b6d003-85c0-415a-802d-0cc91a595670",
                                                "sense_id": "80689fd3-68e8-3060-acfb-c4df3192e454",
                                                "text": "The bathyphase of the metabolic process ran from late evening until shortly after the subject awoke, with the lowest point recorded in at three o'clock in the morning."
